// builtinInventory is every fixed model-facing tool this build registers, with
// the file that defines its name. "Fixed" excludes the two families whose names
// are only known at runtime — MCP servers and plugins — which HandWritten
// covers by prefix instead.
//
// The guard it powers is one sentence: a builtin is either generated by
// toolgen, or an accepted exception. A tool that is neither means someone
// hand-wrote a schema that toolgen could have owned, and this test is where
// that shows up.
